--------------------- CableDyn Input File ------------------------------------
Lazy-wave dynamic power cable in a current with ten discrete buoyancy modules
-- The Gulf of Mexico 80 m lazy-wave cable of lozon_gomex80_power_cable.dat, with its 50 m
-- buoyant stretch built from the bare cable plus ten discrete buoyancy modules at a 5 m pitch
-- (arc 70.614 m to 115.614 m from the fairlead). Each module carries the mass, displaced volume,
-- and normal and axial drag areas of 5 m of the smeared 0.29 m buoyancy section, so this deck and
-- lazy_wave_buoyancy_smeared.dat describe the same cable. The mesh (0.156 m elements) puts a node
-- on every module. A 0.5 m/s uniform current in +X loads cable and modules in the static solve.
